[{"id":4347051959,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAxq_tw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\n\nI'm not sure we need the eye icon to toggle setter/getter visibility, as it's not something I expect people will need to toggle often.\n\nI also agree with @AdriaandeJongh that setters/getters should be hidden by default, as they're not *needed* in GDScript or C#. They're only really required for people writing GDExtension code, at which point I think it's reasonable to ask them to change an editor setting. (They're not required when *using* a GDExtension, only when writing code using a GDExtension binding.)\n\nIf we change this to be hidden by default, then the editor setting should be inverted to `show_property_setters_and_getters`.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119454#pullrequestreview-4347051959","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119454","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119454#pullrequestreview-4347051959"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119454"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-22T16:15:33Z","commit_id":"f022a5e181308517df5032e372010b4a5a50a10d"},{"id":4350294762,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA0w66g","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested this PR and hot damn, this is SO much nicer:\n\n| Before | After |\n|--------|--------|\n| <img width=\"1228\" height=\"1048\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-23 at 10 43 26\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77de8eb1-5798-4eaa-b062-9f773f5c252d\" /> | <img width=\"1246\" height=\"919\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-23 at 10 43 38\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9874944b-b672-4fb7-88d1-946bd3464132\" /> | \n\nDidn't look at the code.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119454#pullrequestreview-4350294762","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119454","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_l